tion=\\\"authfn/core/src/types.ts:232\\\">\\nP3: These new public event types are absent from the canonical observability event catalog; add rows describing their outcomes and metadata so consumers can interpret routing events.</violation>\\n</file>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<sub>Reply with feedback, questions, or to request a fix.<br /><br />[Re-trigger cubic](https://www.cubic.dev/action/re-review/pr/21nCo/super-functions/120/ai_pr_review_1787540496162_b904e2e3-93f1-43f5-888a-ff0ab311b5c5?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fsuper-functions%2Fpull%2F120)</sub>\\n\\n<!-- cubic:review-post:ai_pr_review_1787540496162_b904e2e3-93f1-43f5-888a-ff0ab311b5c5:e763ea93692403c4a405616b3f239e8e094b5c44:1ce485a1-dead-4477-95a7-9a5fa8ddb259 -->\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5004310442\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5004310442\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-08-24T03:20:11Z\",\"commit_id\":\"e763ea93692403c4a405616b3f239e8e094b5c44\"},{\"id\":5004472561,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKkow8Q\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\",\"id\":199175422,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDOC98s_g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1144995?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"star