ad: AUTH-1 (2bd60a1)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - 2bd60a17 — fix(authfn): address latest AUTH-1 review findings\\n  - d7f6446f — AUTH-1: harden canonical gateway review edge cases\\n  - a168fa1a — fix(authfn): address PR review findings\\n  - be0dde5d — AUTH-1: address gateway review findings\\n  - e763ea93 — AUTH-1: satisfy full Python typecheck\\n  - 6641e951 — AUTH-1: add canonical gateway identity routing\\n- Prior pullfrog review: d7f6446 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5008849195)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/120?action=fix&review_id=5010175317) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/120?action=fix-approved&review_id=5010175317) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/32750242315/job/97505232850) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5010175317\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5010175317\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-08-24T16:27:00Z\",\"commit_id\":\"2bd60a175d397267c276498dbb834c8f52bfc497\"},{\"id\":5018087321,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKxnvmQ\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\",\"id\":19917542