nd fix them. If appropriate, use sub-agents to investigate and fix each issue separately.\\n\\n\\n<file name=\\\"authfn/python/authfn/http.py\\\">\\n\\n<violation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"authfn/python/authfn/http.py:671\\\">\\nP1: In gateway mode, `GET /runtime` is not treated as a global runtime endpoint like `/environment`; the gateway attempts identity routing, while a cell requires a routing assertion. Add `/runtime` to the global discovery classification so this compatibility alias works through the canonical gateway.</violation>\\n</file>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<sub>**Tip**: Review your code locally with the [cubic CLI](https://docs.cubic.dev/ide/cli-review?utm_source=github&utm_content=general_review_body) to iterate faster.<br /><br />[Re-trigger cubic](https://www.cubic.dev/action/re-review/pr/21nCo/super-functions/120/ai_pr_review_1787665537228_3386609c-f27d-4710-893c-0135f4265d13?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fsuper-functions%2Fpull%2F120)</sub>\\n\\n<!-- cubic:review-post:ai_pr_review_1787665537228_3386609c-f27d-4710-893c-0135f4265d13:8d845522a7b0d2ca0d9726cc89d7a0ea47c867b6:a5290dc8-f4a6-4877-89dc-71b7859dbd0a -->\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5019682109\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5019682109\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-08-25T13:49:06Z\",\"commit_id\":\"8d845522a7b0d2ca0d9726cc89d7a0ea47c867b6\"},{\"id\":5019690250,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKzJlCg\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\",\"id\":199175422,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDOC98s_g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1144995?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.git