ng_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> Two correctness gaps remain in the new deletion lifecycle and cross-runtime configuration parity.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** Reviewed the `a168fa1` delta since the Pullfrog review written against `be0dde5`.\\n\\n- **Deletion ordering**: Moved placement tombstoning after the account cascade so a failed database delete no longer leaves a surviving account unroutable.\\n- **DynamoDB client validation**: Replaced caller-declared client-region metadata with verification against the supplied document client's configured region while preserving configuration errors.\\n- **Routing contracts**: Aligned retryability, event outcomes and metadata, runtime aliases, canonical topology hiding, and generated documentation.\\n- **Python request execution**: Extracted shared route middleware execution, preserved raw query strings for URL-less adapter requests, and expanded FastAPI, Flask, and OpenAPI coverage.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against a168fa1;\\nif commits have landed on AUTH-1 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 48\\n- Commits reviewed: 4\\n- Base: dev (72aabce)\\n- Head: AUTH-1 (a168fa1)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - a168fa1 — fix(authfn): address PR review findings\\n  - be0dde5 — AUTH-1: address gateway review findings\\n  - e763ea9 — AUTH-1: satisfy full Python typecheck\\n  - 6641e95 — AUTH-1: add canonical gateway identity routing\\n- Prior pullfrog review: be0dde5 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5004498941)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/120?action=fix&review_id=5007081386) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/120?action=fix-approved&review_id=5007081386) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/32719103323/job/97406526902) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5007081386\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5007081386\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-08-24T10:59:27Z\",\"commit_id\":\"a168fa1a001723a323907e2d0b2c1cfd0c0d3fb8\"},{\"id\":5007087305,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKnIWyQ\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\",\"id\":199175422,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDOC98s_g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/114499