/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"<!-- cubic:review-summary:start -->\\n**4 issues found** across 28 files (changes from recent commits).\\n<!-- cubic:review-summary:end -->\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Prompt for AI agents (unresolved issues)</summary>\\n\\n```text\\n\\nCheck if these issues are valid — if so, understand the root cause of each and fix them. If appropriate, use sub-agents to investigate and fix each issue separately.\\n\\n\\n<file name=\\\"authfn/core/src/core/regions.ts\\\">\\n\\n<violation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"authfn/core/src/core/regions.ts:91\\\">\\nP2: When a gateway cell omits `regions` or supplies `[]`, this guard accepts any `routing.cell.regionId`. Python’s `MultiRegionService.resolve_runtime` rejects the equivalent empty catalog, so the same deployment succeeds in TypeScript but fails in Python; align these validation semantics.</violation>\\n</file>\\n\\n<file name=\\\"packages/python-flask/superfunctions_flask/adapter.py\\\">\\n\\n<violation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"packages/python-flask/superfunctions_flask/adapter.py:19\\\">\\nP2: Installing the Flask adapter with the permitted 0.1.0 core package can now fail at import because `execute_route` is not guaranteed by the dependency range. Raise the core dependency to a release containing this export and coordinate the package versions.</violation>\\n</file>\\n\\n<file name=\\\"packages/python-fastapi/superfunctions_fastapi/adapter.py\\\">\\n\\n<violation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"packages/python-fastapi/superfunctions_fastapi/adapter.py:20\\\">\\nP2: Installing the FastAPI adapter with the permitted 0.1.0 core package can now fail at import because `execute_route` is not guaranteed by the dependency range. Raise the core dependency to a release containing this export and coordinate the package versions.</violation>\\n</file>\\n\\n<file name=\\\"authfn/multi-region/src/index.ts\\\">\\n\\n<violation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"authfn/multi-region/src/index.ts:159\\\">\\nP1: When the placement directory is unavailable or its CAS loses a race, account deletion succeeds but this tombstone failure is swallowed by `deleteAccountForUser`. Persist the tombstone in a durable post-delete retry/outbox path, or otherwise make this critical cleanup retriable after the account is gone.</violation>\\n</file>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<sub>**Tip**: Review your code locally with the [cubic CLI](https://docs.cubic.dev/ide/cli-review?utm_source=github&utm_content=general_review_body) to iterate faster.<br /><br />[Re-trigger cubic](https://www.cubic.dev/action/re-review/pr/21nCo/super-functions/120/ai_pr_review_1787568850517_fcf5997b-a8aa-4421-b500-2c1c836a01f1?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fsuper-functions%2Fpull%2F120)</sub>\\n\\n<!-- cubic:review-post:ai_pr_review_1787568850517_fcf5997b-a8aa-4421-b500-2c1c836a01f1:a168fa1a001723a323907e2d0b2c1cfd0c0d3fb8:371d179f-6711-490e-8907-6261c4f84e8b -->\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5007158488\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5007158488\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-08-24T11:08:51Z\",\"commit_id\":\"a168fa1a001723a323907e2d0