w\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"id\":226033991,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODXkBRw\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1768019?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/pullfrog\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> A later deletion hook can strand a live account behind the new durable placement fence.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** Reviewed the `d7f6446` delta since the Pullfrog review written against `a168fa1`.\\n\\n- **Deletion fencing**: Added a durable `deleting` placement state, pre-cascade fencing, failure restoration, fail-closed finalization, and explicit operator repair helpers.\\n- **Routing hardening**: Retained replay claims through accepted clock skew, rejected `deleting` placements before execution, and marked transport failures as indeterminate.\\n- **Runtime parity**: Allowed Python gateway cells without a configured-region catalog while preserving unknown-cell validation for non-empty catalogs.\\n- **Provider and observability fixes**: Pinned internally constructed DynamoDB placement clients to the writer region and preserved canonical `errorCode` metadata while redacting secret-like fields.\\n- **Compatibility updates**: Restored Python runtime/environment route aliases, preserved raw query bytes in URL-less requests, and bumped the shared Python adapter package versions.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against d7f6446;\\nif commits have landed on AUTH-1 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 56\\n- Commits reviewed: 1\\n- Base: dev (72aabce)\\n- Head: AUTH-1 (d7f6446)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - d7f6446 — AUTH-1: harden canonical gateway review edge cases\\n- Prior pullfrog review: a168fa1 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5007081386)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/120?action=fix&review_id=5008849195) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/120?action=fix-approved&review_id=5008849195) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/32737361056/job/97463288373) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5008849195\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5008849195\"},\"pull_request\":{\