tted by Python, `metadata.errorCode` is still redacted while TypeScript now preserves it. Update the Python sanitizer and parity tests so the documented error-code field behaves consistently across runtimes.</violation>\\n</file>\\n\\n<file name=\\\"packages/python-core/pyproject.toml\\\">\\n\\n<violation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"packages/python-core/pyproject.toml:7\\\">\\nP2: This bump leaves the public `superfunctions.__version__` at `0.1.0` while packaging metadata reports `0.1.1`. Update the runtime version constant with the package metadata so version checks and diagnostics agree.</violation>\\n</file>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<sub>**Tip**: Review your code locally with the [cubic CLI](https://docs.cubic.dev/ide/cli-review?utm_source=github&utm_content=general_review_body) to iterate faster.<br /><br />[Re-trigger cubic](https://www.cubic.dev/action/re-review/pr/21nCo/super-functions/120/ai_pr_review_1787580802541_7908a94b-7e2f-4468-ba4f-e95ba5adea9e?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fsuper-functions%2Fpull%2F120)</sub>\\n\\n<!-- cubic:review-post:ai_pr_review_1787580802541_7908a94b-7e2f-4468-ba4f-e95ba5adea9e:d7f6446f6bee158d76ce05df07e7098b53e8b6e1:294072f7-e40b-4ede-a85f-fa6c576b7595 -->\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5008861540\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5008861540\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-08-24T14:21:04Z\",\"commit_id\":\"d7f6446f6bee158d76ce05df07e7098b53e8b6e1\"},{\"id\":5010145409,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKqDAgQ\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"id\":226033991,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODXkBRw\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1768019?v=4