ddress gateway review findings\\n  - a168fa1 — fix(authfn): address PR review findings\\n  - d7f6446 — AUTH-1: harden canonical gateway review edge cases\\n  - 2bd60a1 — fix(authfn): address latest AUTH-1 review findings\\n  - e935b75 — fix(authfn): harden gateway cleanup and migration\\n  - 862575f — fix(authfn): harden deletion and cell routing\\n- Prior pullfrog review: e935b75 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5018104041)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/120?action=fix&review_id=5018552122) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/120?action=fix-approved&review_id=5018552122) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/32844141154/job/97789950123) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5018552122\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5018552122\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-08-25T11:53:14Z\",\"commit_id\":\"862575f1db467cbc65e0e9ca52349908392863e6\"},{\"id\":5019682109,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKzJFPQ\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"cubic-dev-ai[bot]\",\"id\":191113872,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDOC2QqkA\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubus