untimes.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 892f03f;\\nif commits have landed on AUTH-1 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 62\\n- Commits reviewed: 10\\n- Base: dev (72aabce)\\n- Head: AUTH-1 (892f03f)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - 6641e951 - AUTH-1: add canonical gateway identity routing\\n  - e763ea93 - AUTH-1: satisfy full Python typecheck\\n  - be0dde5d - AUTH-1: address gateway review findings\\n  - a168fa1a - fix(authfn): address PR review findings\\n  - d7f6446f - AUTH-1: harden canonical gateway review edge cases\\n  - 2bd60a17 - fix(authfn): address latest AUTH-1 review findings\\n  - e935b752 - fix(authfn): harden gateway cleanup and migration\\n  - 862575f1 - fix(authfn): harden deletion and cell routing\\n  - 8d845522 - fix(authfn): harden gateway deletion and routing\\n  - 892f03fc - fix(authfn): bind deletion cleanup to owned fence\\n- Prior pullfrog review: 8d84552 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5019744714)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/32858395323/job/97835966882) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#pullrequestreview-5020098594\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_li