ed resolution in gateway mode.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Prompt for AI agents</summary>\\n\\n```text\\nCheck if this issue is valid — if so, understand the root cause and fix it. At authfn/python/authfn/plugins/multi_region.py, line 143:\\n\\n<comment>When a forwarded canonical hostname matches another region's broad `domain`, gateway registration can let `_resolve_region()` override `cell_region_id` and assign the wrong region profile and authority. Select `routing.cell_region_id` before host-based resolution in gateway mode.</comment>\\n\\n<file context>\\n@@ -138,7 +138,11 @@ async def register_user(\\n-        register = getattr(self.plugin_config.directory, \\\"register_user\\\", None)\\n+        register = (\\n+            None\\n+            if self.plugin_config.routing and self.plugin_config.routing.mode == \\\"gateway\\\"\\n+            else getattr(self.plugin_config.directory, \\\"register_user\\\", None)\\n+        )\\n</file context>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n✅ Addressed in [`862575f`](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/commit/862575f1db467cbc65e0e9ca52349908392863e6)\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-25T11:06:31Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-25T11:48:16Z\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#discussion_r3852332060\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"_links\":{\"self\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/comments/3852332060\"},\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#discussion_r3852332060\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\"}},\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/comments/3852332060/reactions\",\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"start_line\":null,\"original_start_line\":null,\"start_side\":null,\"line\":155,\"original_line\":143,\