, line 71:\\n\\n<comment>This test does not actually verify the writer-region pin. It only proves the constructor accepts the options, so it still passes if the internal client ignores `writerRegion`.\\n\\nCall a placement method or spy on client construction so the test observes the region override.</comment>\\n\\n<file context>\\n@@ -65,6 +67,15 @@ describe('@authfn/lookup-dynamodb', () => {\\n   });\\n \\n+  it('pins an internally constructed placement client to the writer region', () => {\\n+    expect(() => createDynamoDbIdentityPlacementDirectory({\\n+      tableName: 'authfn-placement',\\n+      consistencyModel: 'single-writer-strong',\\n</file context>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n✅ Addressed in [`2bd60a1`](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/commit/2bd60a175d397267c276498dbb834c8f52bfc497)\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-24T14:21:05Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-24T16:21:46Z\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#discussion_r3844345344\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\",\"_links\":{\"self\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/comments/3844345344\"},\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#discussion_r3844345344\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/120\"}},\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/comments/3844345344/reactions\",\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"start_line\":null,\"original_start_line\":null,\"start_side\":null,\"line\":null,\"original_line\":71,\"side\":\"RIGHT\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"original_position\":71,\"position\":1,\"subject_type\":\"line\"},{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/comments/3845394562\",\"pull_request_review_id\":5010145409,\"id\":3845394562,\"node_id\":\"PRRC_kwDOP-e7KM