thfn.routing.retry`, `authfn.routing.assertion_rejected`, `authfn.routing.directory_unavailable`, and `authfn.routing.cell_unavailable`. Alert on directory/cell availability, mismatch-retry exhaustion, and assertion rejection rather than logging identity keys or assertion contents.\\n```\\n\\n✅ Addressed in [`be0dde5`](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/commit/be0dde5d0b2fc65c877f304ff68feb0e0717013a)\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"cubic-dev-ai\"},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-24T03:20:12Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-24T04:07:45Z\",\"outdated\":true,\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#discussion_r3840490378\",\"diffHunk\":\"@@ -135,6 +148,8 @@ The plugin emits:\\n - `authfn.region.lookup` — every successful region lookup. Carries `identifier`, `regionId`, `authority`.\\n - `authfn.region.lookup.conflict` — when a registration attempt loses a race.\\n \\n+Gateway deployments can additionally emit `authfn.routing.placement_lookup`, `placement_claimed`, `forwarded`, `mismatch`, `retry`, `assertion_rejected`, `directory_unavailable`, and `cell_unavailable`. Alert on directory/cell availability, mismatch-retry exhaustion, and assertion rejection rather than logging identity keys or assertion contents.\",\"originalLine\":151,\"line\":null,\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"e763ea93692403c4a405616b3f239e8e094b5c44\"}}]}},{\"id\":\"PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6bkdtu\",\"isResolved\":true,\"isOutdated\":false,\"path\":\"authfn/docs/static/llms-full.txt\",\"line\":5974,\"originalLine\":5946,\"comments\":{\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"PRRC_kwDOP-e7KM7k6TuS\",\"body\":\"<!-- cubic:v=d2f3b3fc-16e8-4982-86a6-d818c13ac1de -->\\n<!-- cubic:review-run=1ce485a1-dead-4477-95a7-9a5fa8ddb259 -->\\n<!-- metadata:{\\\"confidence\\\":10} -->\\nP3: The multi-region runtime configuration reference omits `routing`, so readers cannot discover the gateway configuration from the primary API contract. Add `routing?: AuthFnCanonicalRoutingConfig` to this interface.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Prompt for AI agents</summary>\\n\\n```text\\nCheck if this issue is valid — if so, understand the root cause and fix it. At authfn/docs/static/llms-full.txt, line 5946:\\n\\n<comment>The multi-region runtime configuration reference omits `routing`, so readers cannot discover the gateway configuration from the primary API contract. Add `routing?: AuthFnCanonicalRoutingConfig` to this interface.</comment>\\n\\n<file context>\\n@@ -5913,14 +5932,18 @@ authFnMultiRegionPlugin({\\n-  lookupStore?: AuthFnRegionLookupStore;\\n-  directory?: AuthFnMultiRegionDirectory;          // deprecated, use lookupStore\\n+  lookupStore?: ConditionalKVStoreAdapter;\\n+  observability?: ObservabilityInput<AuthFnEvent>;\\n }\\n \\n</file context>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n```suggestion\\n  observability?: ObservabilityInput<AuthFnEvent>;\\n  routing?: AuthFnCanonicalRoutingConfig;\\n```\\n\\n✅ Addressed in [`be0dde5`](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/commit/be0dde5d0b2fc65c877f304ff68feb0e0717013a)\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"cubic-dev-ai\"},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-24T03:20:13Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-24T04:07:37Z\",\"outdated\":false,\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/120#discussion_r3840490386\",\"diffHunk\":\"@@ -5913,14 +5932,18 @@ authFnMultiRegionPlugin({\\n });\\n ```\\n \\n+Add `plugin` to the AuthFn plugin list and pass `environment` to\\n+`createServer`. Routing and store settings are request-runtime configuration;\\n+they are intentionally separate from the plugin's schema contribution.\\n+\\n ## Configuration\\n \\n ```ts\\n-interface MultiRegionPluginConfig {\\n+interface MultiRegionPluginRuntimeConfig {\\n   regions?: AuthFnMultiRegionRegionConfig[];\\n   defaultRegionId?: string;\\n-  lookupStore?: AuthFnRegionLookupStore;\\n-  directory?: AuthFnMultiRegionDirectory;          // deprecated, use lookupStore\\n+  lookupStore?: ConditionalKVStoreAdapter;\\n+  observability?: ObservabilityInput<AuthFnEvent>;\",\"originalLine\":5946,\"line\":5974,\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"bf